WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.388 --> 00:00:02.888
(light music)

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.386
- [Narrator] Over the past few weeks,

00:00:05.386 --> 00:00:08.841
Great Big Story and Modelo have
celebrated a town that for us

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.960
represents the best vision
for the future of America.

00:00:11.960 --> 00:00:13.725
(chimes)

00:00:13.725 --> 00:00:16.078
A town that's brought
together by a common spirit

00:00:16.078 --> 00:00:20.047
of hard work and a shared
sense of community.

00:00:20.047 --> 00:00:22.707
That spirit recently came under attack.

00:00:22.707 --> 00:00:24.227
- [Reporter] Three men
in Kansas are facing

00:00:24.227 --> 00:00:25.671
domestic terrorism charges.

00:00:25.671 --> 00:00:28.694
Federal authorities say the
men were plotting to bomb an

00:00:28.694 --> 00:00:31.717
apartment complex and mosque
filled with Somali immigrants.

00:00:31.717 --> 00:00:34.045
We have our national correspondence...

00:00:34.045 --> 00:00:35.547
- [Narrator] We spent a
month living in Garden City

00:00:35.547 --> 00:00:38.459
while working on this series.

00:00:38.459 --> 00:00:40.377
The community welcomed us with open arms,

00:00:40.377 --> 00:00:43.683
and shared their
inspiring stories with us.

00:00:43.683 --> 00:00:45.365
- I don't think people realize how much

00:00:45.365 --> 00:00:47.929
energy and effort it takes to hate.

00:00:47.929 --> 00:00:51.683
It's so much easier,
and so much less drama,

00:00:51.683 --> 00:00:53.925
just to be loving and accepting.

00:00:53.925 --> 00:00:56.783
I believe providing a
safe haven for people

00:00:56.783 --> 00:01:00.042
is part of being a decent human being,

00:01:00.042 --> 00:01:02.056
it's how we should treat each other,

00:01:02.056 --> 00:01:04.376
and I'm glad to see we do that here.

00:01:04.376 --> 00:01:05.819
(light music)

00:01:05.819 --> 00:01:06.834
- Garden City make me
like my home, you know,

00:01:06.834 --> 00:01:08.212
I feel like my home.

00:01:08.212 --> 00:01:11.872
I would just want to live here
peaceful, making big change.

00:01:11.872 --> 00:01:15.446
All people from Africa and
people of others live here.

00:01:15.446 --> 00:01:17.631
I'm open the doors right now.

00:01:17.631 --> 00:01:18.925
And I take that responsibility,

00:01:18.925 --> 00:01:21.062
'cause I see people need help.

00:01:21.062 --> 00:01:24.093
I will have to be united for everybody.

00:01:24.093 --> 00:01:25.461
I'm not going nowhere.

00:01:25.461 --> 00:01:28.090
- There's the reason all of us are here,

00:01:28.090 --> 00:01:30.922
just to work hard and help our family.

00:01:30.922 --> 00:01:32.964
Not to bring all these
bad things, you know,

00:01:32.964 --> 00:01:34.541
it's not like that.

00:01:34.541 --> 00:01:36.763
Our hearts are bigger than this.

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:40.184
- The world can learn a lot
about this little community,

00:01:40.184 --> 00:01:43.461
because if we surviving
here, so many years,

00:01:43.461 --> 00:01:46.806
and we still together, it’s because
we understand each other.

00:01:46.806 --> 00:01:50.085
It's not only us, it's everybody.

00:01:50.085 --> 00:01:51.909
- [Narrator] Great Big
Story and Modelo believe

00:01:51.909 --> 00:01:53.358
in the fighting spirit.

00:01:53.358 --> 00:01:56.203
We stand alongside
those who work together.

00:01:56.203 --> 00:01:59.443
And we celebrate our
friends in Garden City.

00:01:59.443 --> 00:02:00.650
(light music)

00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:03.656
- Regardless of what color,
race, country, ethnicity,

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:05.325
that you are or where you've come from,

00:02:05.325 --> 00:02:07.831
we're all here together.

00:02:07.831 --> 00:02:09.059
Garden City's doing it.

00:02:09.059 --> 00:02:10.980
Why can't the rest of us?

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:13.563
(light music)

